{
  "run_id": "PMC13114876__scimon__trend_o1_ground_b_o3mini__s2",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Post-sintering high-temperature annealing of AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 will optimize spinel oxide formation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The spinel oxide formed on annealed AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 will be stable and protective.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealing-induced oxide layer will reduce degradation under simultaneous wear, elevated temperature, and corrosive exposure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Systematic high-temperature annealing can refine the microstructure of the sintered alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11087546::chunk::001::introduction::0e6321125d"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature annealing promotes development of an adherent spinel oxide scale on AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Friction and thermal exposure will produce a dense, well-adhered spinel oxide tribo-layer on the alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing enhances diffusion in AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing enhances phase stability in AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced diffusion and phase stability cause formation of the proposed protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A compact protective oxide scale can restrict further oxidation and corrosive attack by acting as a diffusion barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide scale will mitigate mechanical wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealed samples will have lower wear rates than untreated samples under identical high-temperature tribo-corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealed samples will have less corrosion-related degradation than untreated samples under identical high-temperature tribo-corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spark-plasma-sintered AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 without controlled annealing typically develops less protective or more inhomogeneous oxide layers.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The less protective oxide layers of the untreated baseline result in accelerated degradation.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The benefits of annealing will be greatest when high temperature, mechanical abrasion, and corrosive media act together.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The outcome may vary with the specific degradation environment and testing conditions.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6317005::chunk::001::introduction::42ad25eeb0",
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    }
